  out.push("");
  out.push("*Write your thoughts about this theme after the line below. At minimum, you should include a \"Theme definition\" that explains, in two or three sentences, what this theme is about and what holds these codes together as a coherent theme. You can also add any other observations or insights that will be helpful when writing up your final report.*");

